# Keyboard window managers (Raycast, Rectangle, Magnet) move and resize the frontmost app's
# focused window through accessibility, and only a standard window. AppKit reports a
# non-activating panel as a system dialog, so Raycast's shortcuts did nothing to a Little Window
# while they moved other browsers (X, 17 Nov 2026). Its page window docked in it is no window.
seed settings.json {"toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
from://debug?windowSize=1200x800
from://open?url=${PAGE}?n=main
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 2
from://debug?windowManagers=main
expect-log window managers main: main=yes$

from://debug?externalURL=${PAGE}?n=little
wait 3
from://debug?windowManagers=little
expect-log window managers little: little=yes main=yes$
reject-log fault:
